WEBVTT

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.740
<i>In the year 2020 C.E.,</i>

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.080
<i>the human world is connected by a network.</i>

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:23.910
<i>Inhabiting it is
an unknown life form called Digimon.</i>

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.190
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.190
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:54.280
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:54.280
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.050
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.050
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.260
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.260
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:26.440
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:26.440
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.860
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.860
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.660
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.660
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:42.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:42.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:47.750
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:47.750
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:52.630
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:52.630
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:58.430
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:58.430
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:04.260
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:04.260
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.730
<i>In the Digital World,</i>

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.900
<i>Taichi reunites with Agumon.</i>

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.990
<i>Taichi's classmate Sora has now joined,</i>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.240
<i>and their journey to save Tokyo
from coming to a halt has begun.</i>

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.710
<i>Koshiro wanders inside the Network.</i>

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.380
<i>Sora meets Piyomon.</i>

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.130
<i>And evolution occurs.</i>

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.470
<i>After the children fight off
wild Digimon that come to attack,</i>

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:49.100
<i>they follow the directions
of a mysterious voice and arrive at...</i>

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:52.560
Is it... a temple?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:54.730
Hm?

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:04.120
THE HOLY DIGIMON

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.260
"Feel my words"...

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.740
You sure have guts,
Koshiro-san.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.740
TENTOMON

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.330
We're inside a Digimon's stomach,
you know?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.330
But I can still communicate
with the outside.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.880
What we need right now is information.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:03.510
If we collect information, we should
be able to see what our next moves are.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.600
Brilliant... I truly admire you!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.560
By the way, what is this Digimon?

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:11.310
This is Whamon.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:14.020
WHAMON

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.690
Whamon is a laid-back Digimon
who swims slowly within the Network...

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.020
Whoa!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.980
My goodness!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:19.940
Taichi-san!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.150
<i>Something just lit up!</i>

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.620
<i>A Digimon... with wings?</i>

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.670
AGUMON

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.670
I remember this feeling.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.790
Yeah.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.000
PIYOMON

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.420
How warm.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.470
Oh, children...

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:52.730
The children who possess the Digivice...

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.850
Digivice?

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:01.440
We are the ones who govern
the good of the Digital World.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:07.240
We leave here the knowledge you must
attain with the last of our powers.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.330
There was once a large war.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:17.210
This is the place
that became our last stronghold.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.260
What?!

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:42.270
The light and darkness
of the Digital World...

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:46.740
Darkness broke the continued balance
between the opposing powers

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.530
and began to make its move.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:52.330
Agumon?!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:56.080
I wonder why? I'm getting the chills!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.420
Piyomon?

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.590
I don't like them!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.050
The darkness that infested the world...

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.100
We went to battle against them
with all the power we held.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.520
With our brave warriors among us.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.460
Thus...

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.720
Darkness was defeated.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.310
The damages were great,

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.480
and our existence was also...

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:21.870
Agumon?!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.540
Why are you crying?

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.090
I don't know...

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.430
I don't know,
but I'm getting tears in my eyes.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.560
Don't worry, I'm here.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.640
Yeah...

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:43.850
We believed a new darkness
would be born in the future.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.570
The Dark Digimon
will begin making its move.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.530
That is when the ones
who possess power will appear

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:55.450
to resurrect the warriors' souls
and to guide them.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.330
<i>They will fight and learn,
accumulating power.</i>

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>They will end their infancy,
grow, and mature.</i>

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.040
<i>This is the life of Digimon.</i>

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:12.760
<i>All who are born within the Digital World
follow the law of evolution.</i>

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.640
Evolution will eventually
reach completion,

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:20.350
but will continue further
into infinite boundaries...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.190
<i>That white Digimon from before...</i>

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.690
A white Digimon?

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.190
You don't remember?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.440
Hmm?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:34.780
As our lives came to an end,
we had a mysterious prevision.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.240
A power which surpasses
the law of evolution.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:44.750
<i>The ones who descend to this world
with the Digivices' light in their hands.</i>

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:50.840
<i>The human children who fight
and walk beside Digimon.</i>

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:59.890
They are our last hope who can protect
the world after we perish...

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.770
The Chosen Ones.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.600
That's us?

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.400
Beware...

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.190
<i>The Network born from human hands.</i>

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.150
<i>It connects the Digital World
and the human world.</i>

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.530
<i>It is a territory
where our eyes cannot reach.</i>

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:20.120
<i>If darkness cannot be stopped, its effects
will spread through the Network,</i>

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>and bring disaster to the human world.</i>

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:28.750
<i>Isn't that related to what's happening
right now in our world?</i>

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.500
Taichi-san,

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:34.010
half of Tokyo is already out of power.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.010
But it's strange.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.970
<i>Each power substations'
main systems are stopped,</i>

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.930
<i>but they can't cut the power
for some reason.</i>

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.890
<i>"How's there still internet on my phone?"</i>

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.730
<i>"I unplugged my computer,
but it's still running!"</i>

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:50.480
<i>If the power outage has spread this much,
how is there still internet?</i>

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.530
-Whoa!
-What is it?!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.120
Koshiro?!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>What's the matter, Whamon?!</i>

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.120
Koshiro!

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.600
ORGEMON

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.660
Children...

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:53.170
Just as we have, darkness has also

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:59.260
detected your existence
and will rise against you.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.720
To win against darkness,

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.180
I will state what you must accomplish.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:11.060
Set out from here, cross the sea,
and aim for the continent.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.690
There you will meet

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:18.570
the light and hope
who fight amongst warriors.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.900
The Holy Digimon.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.910
The Holy... Digimon?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.450
Cloud Continent...

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.500
That is where the Holy Digimon...

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.670
Watch out!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.670
Whoa!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.260
Piyomon!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.930
Taichi, hurry!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.980
Those are Dokugumon!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.440
DOKUGUMON

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.730
There's a bunch of them!

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:58.820
I can't believe this many Dokugumon
would work together in a group!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.610
Normally, they just lie in wait
at their own nest for prey...

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:06.410
We're completely trapped.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.120
This is definitely weird!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:12.000
I've never heard of Dokugumon
hunt like this before!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.880
So that means they're
clearly targeting us on purpose.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.090
If that's true...

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:23.800
What that voice said
about a new darkness born in the future,

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.310
has it already noticed
our existence and made a move?

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:32.730
I. Found. The children.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.860
TYLOMON

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.490
Koshiro-san!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.240
Got you.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.490
Thank you, Tentomon!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.910
But what's happening outside Whamon?

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.130
Sorry, Whamon, bear with us for a minute.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.420
Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.310
These are Tylomon! They're dangerous!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.190
Looks like we're their target right now!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.730
Tentomon, let's back away
from Whamon like this!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.360
Koshiro-san...

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.570
Okay!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.320
Whamon! This is your chance to run!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.920
The odds are against us
in this closed space.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.130
We gotta bust through that web first!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.760
Okay!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.380
Baby Flame!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.600
Huh?

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.230
What's going on?

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.940
That's no ordinary web.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.940
If you look close, it's shaking.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.570
And can't you hear a weird sound?

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.610
This sound is vibrating the web.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.910
That's what erased Agumon's flames!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.330
Maybe there's something else
besides Dokugumon...

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.960
Magical Fire!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.870
Piyomon!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.340
Sora, I'm going to fight too!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:26.670
If I do it,
I might be able to break that web!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.350
Koshiro-san? What are you doing?

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.650
Analyzing.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.820
If I could predict
Tylomon's attack patterns,

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.570
I think there'll be a chance to attack.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.820
There's... another different Digimon!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.620
What? Is that true?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:00.620
Whoa!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.960
Hup!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.250
There! That's the Digimon!

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.590
That's Soundbirdmon.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:10.340
SOUNDBIRDMON

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:11.260
Soundbirdmon is a troublesome Digimon
that uses sound to cause mischief!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.510
Sound...

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.180
Maybe that's what's controlling Tylomon
with sound waves?

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.770
Ahh! They're on to us already!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.020
Tentomon!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.480
You can get away if you're on your own!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.730
Let go of me once, then you can atta--

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.940
Don't be stupid! I could never do that!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.530
Koshiro-san!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.710
Koshiro-san...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.500
I'm...

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.130
I'm going to...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.890
Tentomon!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.730
Koshiro-san!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.440
I swear... I'm going to...

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.320
protect you!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.780
Koshiro-san!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.280
Tentomon!

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.500
Tentomon Evolution!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.630
Kabuterimon!

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:42.520
KABUTERIMON

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.520
How's that, Koshiro-san?!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.100
Kabu... terimon...

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.690
Tentomon has evolved!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.280
Koshiro-san, I'm just getting started!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.950
I'll show you what I've really got
from here!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.620
Then here we go!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.210
Baby Flame!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.010
Piyomon Evolution!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.920
Birdramon!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.590
Everyone, hold on tight!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.590
BIRDRAMON

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.680
Okay!

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.470
We're counting on you, Birdramon!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.820
Now, this is where we come in!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.650
Yeah!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:58.390
Agumon Evolution!

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.150
Greymon!

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.110
GREYMON

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.200
Mega Flame!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.090
Taichi, there's more coming!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.960
This is endless... let's shake them off!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.210
Gotcha!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:41.760
There's no mistake!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.770
Soundbirdmon's sound waves
are controlling Tylomon!

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:48.770
Then we'll make it quiet!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.350
Here we go!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.410
Mega Blaster!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.550
Yes! The Tylomon are fleeing!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.380
That's how it's done!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.720
We shook them off somehow.

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.520
Piyomon, it's all thanks to you.
Thank you!

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.560
Sure!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.600
We did it, Piyomon!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.740
We couldn't hear the whole story.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.120
<i>Taichi-san, this is Koshiro here.</i>

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.410
Koshiro!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.620
<i>You all right?</i>

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.500
Yes!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.170
We were attacked, but we got through it.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.000
It's all thanks to Kabuterimon!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.670
<i>I'm so glad!</i>

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.500
<i>Kabuterimon?</i>

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.510
Something amazing has happened!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.930
Tentomon has evolved!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.590
<i>Whoa, that's great!</i>

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.680
Yeah!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.140
Oh yeah!

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.310
<i>Please be careful of this Digimon.</i>

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.060
<i>It attacked us
by manipulating other Digimon.</i>

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.320
I think I saw one in our battle earlier!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.820
<i>It's called Soundbirdmon.</i>

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.280
<i>Got it.</i>

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.610
<i>You watch out too, Koshiro!</i>

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.570
Yes.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.700
Now, let's hurry over to your friends.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.000
Maybe the reason why I was sent here alone

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.330
was so I could meet you.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.460
What? I couldn't hear you.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.340
It's nothing!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.720
No such thing as nothing!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.260
You were saying something about me.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.600
It's seriously nothing, okay?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.520
You sure? You really sure?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.100
I'm sure! I'm really sure!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.160
Follow. The children.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:28.970
<i>We trust in you...</i>

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.520
<i>The Chosen Ones.</i>

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:07.340
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:07.340
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:11.220
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:11.220
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:21.270
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:21.270
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:24.440
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:24.440
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:27.070
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:27.070
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:30.910
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:30.910
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.040
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.040
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:42.210
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:42.210
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.550
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.550
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.720 --> 00:23:00.600
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.720 --> 00:23:00.600
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:05.320
<i>Taichi meets Mimi,
a girl who protects small Digimon.</i>

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>He and his friends counter
the ferocious enemies' attacks!</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:12.490
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Targeted Kingdom"</i>

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.120
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
